{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bell &amp; Hoof: The Silent Journey</strong> is a tiny walking simulator where you play as a gentle cow wandering a sunlit field. There\u2019s no combat, no puzzles \u2014 just a peaceful path to walk, a few bells to collect, and a chapel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc04 Explore a hand-crafted golden landscape<br>\ud83d\udd14 Find collectible bells hidden around the field<br>\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Walk, moo, or do absolutely nothing at all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is short, simple, and made with love. It\u2019s under 10 minutes long \u2014 more of a vibe than a challenge. If you enjoy quiet moments, warm colors, and weirdly meditative cow energy, you might just like this.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647900?t=1748739229","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647900?t=1748739229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647900/b32756cfcb33b5af25a2ceae18125a4c6e255963/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748739229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647900/b32756cfcb33b5af25a2ceae18125a4c6e255963/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748739229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bell &amp; Hoof: The Silent Journey</strong> is a tiny walking simulator where you play as a gentle cow wandering a sunlit field. There\u2019s no combat, no puzzles \u2014 just a peaceful path to walk, a few bells to collect, and a chapel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc04 Explore a hand-crafted golden landscape<br>\ud83d\udd14 Find collectible bells hidden around the field<br>\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Walk, moo, or do absolutely nothing at all</p><p